 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "You sit in judgment on another",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.41,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Condemning them for what they do",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.8,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But you the judge do the same",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.65,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "No excuse remains for you",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.29,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "God's judgment comes according to truth",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.27,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "On those who act in such a way",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.4,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Do you think you will escape",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.12,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "When you judge others day by day",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.18,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Do you despise the riches of his kindness",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.28,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Forbearance and patience toward you",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.25,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Not realizing his kindness",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 0.61,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Is meant to lead you to repentance",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.24,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Stubborn heart and unrepentant soul",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.73,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
